<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Rizxel - Third-Party Licenses</title>
<style>
body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 960px; margin: 2em auto; padding: 0 1em; color: #222; }
h1 { font-size: 1.6em; } h2 { font-size: 1.2em; margin-top: 2em; }
.licenses-overview li { margin: .2em 0; }
.license-used-by { margin: .5em 0 1em; }
pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f6f6f6; padding: 1em; border-radius: 4px; font-size: .85em; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-Party Licenses</h1>
<p>Rizxel is free software under the GNU General Public License v3 or later (see <code>LICENSE</code>).
It is built with the open-source libraries below, each under its own license. The vendored
<code>craft-ui</code> docking library is under MIT OR Apache-2.0; its license files and
<code>NOTICE</code> ship next to this file in the <code>craft-ui</code> folder.</p>
<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul class="licenses-overview">
{{#each overview}}
<li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<h2>All license texts</h2>
{{#each licenses}}
<div class="license">
<h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
<p class="license-used-by">Used by:
{{#each used_by}}
<a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a>{{#unless @last}},{{/unless}}
{{/each}}
</p>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
</div>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
